</table>
<p style="Standard" xid="42" props="bgcolor:#e6e6e6">After the table comes a p<a xlink:href="https://word42.org/" xid="43">ictu</a>re, a note, a link and a bookmark.<field type="footnote_ref" footnote-id="0" xid="45" props="text-position:superscript"></field><foot footnote-id="0" xid="46">
<p style="Standard" xid="47"><field type="footnote_anchor" footnote-id="0" xid="48"></field>A footnote, at the foot of its page.</p>
</foot></p>
<p style="Standard" xid="49">A picture: <image dataid="0" xid="50" props="height:0.6667in; width:1.0000in"/></p>
<p style="Heading 2" xid="51" props="margin-bottom:0.0417in; margin-top:0.1667in">The scripts of the world</p>
<p style="Standard" xid="52">Russian Здравствуйте, Greek Καλημέρα, Chinese 你好世界, Japanese こんにちは, Korean 안녕하세요, Hebrew שלום, Thai สวัสดี.</p>
<p style="Standard" xid="53" props="text-align:right; dom-dir:rtl">النص العربي يكتب من اليمين.</p>
<p style="Standard" xid="54">The last paragraph.<field type="endnote_ref" endnote-id="0" xid="55" props="text-position:superscript"></field><endnote endnote-id="0" xid="56">
<p style="Standard" xid="57"><field type="endnote_anchor" endnote-id="0" xid="58"></field>An endnote, after the text.</p>
</endnote></p>
</section>
